WEBVTT

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:03.740
Light.

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:06.620
Let there be light...

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:07.860
Let there be excitement!

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:11.440
New game start!

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:15.750
Farewell to this world, 
the crappy game known as reality!

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:18.200
And now,

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.340
I've returned...

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:23.910
To the dating sim world!

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.040
My name is Keima Katsuragi.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.350
Seventeen years old, born on June 6th.

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:32.300
I love the girls in games.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:37.290
In contrast, real girls are unreasonable, 
snobbish, and irrational...

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:39.390
Completely beyond hope!

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:41.720
But one day,

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:45.770
I signed a contract with Elsie, 
a demon from Hell,

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:49.900
forcing me to conquer real girls.

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:53.400
I help them fall in love,

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:57.320
to chase the loose souls from the 
emptiness in their hearts.

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:02.700
Loose soul in custody!

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:06.960
If I fail, the collar around my neck will activate.

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:10.340
A very extreme rule, if I do say so.

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:15.420
But having cleared all kinds of dating sims, 
earning the nickname God of Conquest,

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:17.930
there is no girl I cannot conquer!

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:21.220
<b>Boy</b>

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:21.220
That's a boy...

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:25.360
This degree of difficulty is nothing for me!

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:29.080
I understand you well... 
I know how you feel deep inside.

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:30.690
Because...

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:34.490
I have experienced being a girl!

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:43.440
E-Excuse me!

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:45.370
Are you injured?!

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:49.070
<b>Before you apologize, 
get off me.</b>

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:49.120
<b>Yui Goido 
Class: 2-A 

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:47.940
<i>This was during my conquest of Yui Goido,</i>

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:49.380
<i>daughter of a rich, famous family.</i>

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:55.310
Apparently, the loose soul 
has caused Yui and me

00:01:55.310 --> 00:01:56.420
to switch bodies!

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:57.620
Eh?!

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:01.930
<i>Well, in games, I see this happen all the time.</i>

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:06.060
This is the body of a girl...

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.480
<b>Conquering a girls' 
dating sim
(obsessively)</b>

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.480
<b>New respect for 
the real world.</b>

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.480
<i>Score one for the real world.</i>

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:11.610
Master Keima, do not worry.

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:13.570
If we never regain our bodies,

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:15.260
I will still protect you...

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:17.570
Even if it costs me my life!

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:19.530
Thank you...

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:32.360
You've already captured fourteen loose souls?

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:32.960
Yep.

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:36.000
All thanks to my Divine Brother!

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:39.410
Ugh, how infuriating... He's a total creep.

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:41.870
Huh? My brother's really cool...

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:42.970
Every once in a while.

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:44.880
It's been a while, Haqua!

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:47.140
Ah, hello...

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:48.630
Wow, that smells wonderful.

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:50.360
Make yourself at home.

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:51.720
Thank you!

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:55.570
I guess appearance doesn't matter for a buddy...

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:57.110
That reminds me...

00:02:57.110 --> 00:03:00.720
I haven't ever met your buddy.

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:01.860
What's your buddy like?

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:04.270
A-Ah...

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:06.370
<b>Tai Chi Lesson (1)</b>

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:08.730
This is hard.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:08.730
Well,

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.370
she's pretty normal.

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:15.630
"When I kiss you, I feel like I'm kissing a girl."

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:17.600
Conquest complete.

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:23.220
Underclassman, ghost, ramen cook, 
shogi player, older woman...

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:26.510
After racking up real-world conquests,

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:27.910
real girls are no problem!

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:29.790
However,

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:33.230
I had trouble understanding 
a real-life mad scientist...

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:35.140
Akari Kurakawa.

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:38.690
I hope I don't encounter another one

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:42.270
that makes no sense, 
then disappears without a trace.

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:46.410
Crap!

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:47.790
Is something fried?

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:04.900
This observatory is for Luna and me, 
so you should keep out.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:09.470
I am only interested in beauty.

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:10.470
Not my problem.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:16.730
<b>Tsukiyo Kujo 
Class: 2-A 

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:13.730
<i>Tsukiyo Kujo</i>

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:16.730
<i>wanted everything to be beautiful, like her dolls.</i>

00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:19.860
<i>And the loose soul inside her</i>

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:22.400
<i>shrank her to doll size.</i>

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:25.000
Tsukiyo!

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:28.220
Keep back...

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:33.710
This world contains so much beauty!

00:04:34.220 --> 00:04:34.960
Keima!

00:04:35.990 --> 00:04:39.210
We can search for beauty together!

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:41.460
I won't let you go to the moon!

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:44.630
Keima!

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:46.380
Tsukiyo...

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:54.640
<i>Once the conquest is complete 
and the loose soul exorcised,</i>

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:57.280
<i>the girls forget everything that transpired.</i>

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:04.310
<i>I'm the only one who remembers 
what happened between us.</i>

00:05:05.890 --> 00:05:08.160
Divine Brother!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.530
It's time to get started!

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:11.790
Save, save...

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.350
Save! Save!

00:05:19.390 --> 00:05:20.550
Continue.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:07.300
<i>Together, we can run forever!</i>

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:10.650
That was Kanon Nakagawa!

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:11.610
Bang.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:17.230
You have three radio shows tonight.

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:17.890
Okay.

00:07:17.890 --> 00:07:20.410
Followed by some additional 
recording at Aokawa Studios.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:21.130
Okay.

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:23.040
And the song you just did for—

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.050
Ms. Okada?

00:07:24.050 --> 00:07:24.860
Yes?

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:27.020
Could I do some studying?

00:07:27.020 --> 00:07:28.800
I have a test tomorrow.

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:30.670
Ah, I forgot...

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:35.220
It's getting busier by the day.

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:37.680
I hope I'll have time for finals.

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:38.930
Enough griping...

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:40.810
Focus! Focus!

00:07:59.740 --> 00:08:00.850
Kanon...

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:01.960
Kanon!

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:03.420
Come on, Kanon!

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:04.780
Wake up!

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:09.600
You're supposed to be studying right now!

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:10.340
<i>She's back.</i>

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:12.220
No sleeping!

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:13.980
Apollo...

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:16.670
Today, you sang with lots of love.

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:19.620
I can feel my power returning!

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:22.510
Your power? Who are you?

00:08:22.510 --> 00:08:24.980
Didn't I explain all of this a month ago?

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:27.480
I am a goddess from the heavens.

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:29.660
What do you mean by "goddess"?

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:31.600
And why are you here?

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:34.320
That I do not know...

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:37.120
One moment, I was sealing the Weiss,

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.020
and next thing I knew, I was here.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.500
What I do know is that...

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:45.750
Something happened, something happened, 
and something happened, so I'm here!

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:47.090
There's your answer.

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:48.730
That doesn't tell me anything!

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:50.560
Well, it isn't important.

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:54.490
I am a descendant of Apollo, god of the arts.

00:08:54.490 --> 00:08:56.510
You can probably use my blessing!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:08:59.920
<i>Am I so tired,</i>

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:02.940
<i>I'm starting to see things?</i>

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:08.700
We're off!

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:10.120
Take care!

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:12.650
Wait for me, Exalted Brother!

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:12.650
U-Um...

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:17.440
G-Good morning, Keima.

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:18.780
It's Tenri!

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:21.160
Good morning.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.620
Good morning, Elsie.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:23.930
Did you need something, Tenri?

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:25.500
Ah, well...

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:27.960
Diana wants to talk to you.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.610
That's nice... Maybe later.

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:39.620
Diana!

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:42.220
Why do you insist on being so cold?

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:45.320
You were just reunited with Tenri 
after a ten-year separation,

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:47.020
and you even shared a kiss.

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:51.540
I was putting on an act to get rid of Nora.

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:53.010
You know that.

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:55.470
Anyway, when did that thing appear?

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:56.710
It's a halo!

00:09:56.710 --> 00:09:59.360
This ring is the symbol of the goddesses.

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:01.830
Tenri's love helped to restore it.

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:03.200
Goddesses?

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:07.080
Yes, I come from the heavens.

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:10.690
Your people would refer to us as

00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:13.090
gods.

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:16.890
You aren't surprised?

00:10:16.890 --> 00:10:18.590
There's a demon standing over there.

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:21.150
If there are demons, there must be gods.

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:23.120
I'm glad you're so quick to understand.

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:27.350
But the moment you said 
you weren't a loose soul,

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:30.490
you stopped being my problem.

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:31.840
You're still saying that?

00:10:31.840 --> 00:10:33.870
So, what do you want?

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:38.360
I need you to marry Tenri.

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:39.610
Huh?

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:43.970
Loose souls feed on negative energy,

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:47.120
while goddesses require the 
power of love to grow.

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:52.600
To fuel my power, I need more love.

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:56.340
If you marry Tenri, she will be happy,

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:58.620
and my power will return.

00:10:58.620 --> 00:10:59.630
That is why

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:01.380
you must marry her.

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:02.970
Don't be absurd!

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:04.870
Why must you be so difficult?

00:11:04.870 --> 00:11:07.600
You should pay more attention to Tenri.

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:11.350
<b>Ayukawa Residence 

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:09.930
She moved next to you,

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:12.030
but you spend all your time on other girls.

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:15.090
Start by walking to school 
together every morning.

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:16.650
We attend different schools!

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:20.640
It's Kanon!

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:23.910
She comes when we have tests!

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:25.410
Good morning.

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:38.590
<b>From: Manager Okada 
To: Kanon 

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:34.260
<i>Ms. Okada...</i>

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:37.620
You're really popular!

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:39.220
A real sight to see!

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:42.050
Okay! Let's begin the test!

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:43.090
Kids!

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:45.480
This is your time of reckoning!

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:48.350
Katsuragi!

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:50.810
Put away your game!

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:54.170
<i>First demons, now goddesses...</i>

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:55.230
Katsuragi, are you listening?

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:56.070
<i>Why does this stuff keep happening to me?</i>

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:56.070
Hey!

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:58.200
Do as I say...

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:01.130
Katsuragi!

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:05.900
Huh? Kanon isn't here.

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:07.610
Didn't she come to school?

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:09.230
Her popularity hasn't faded.

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:10.220
No kidding...

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:14.790
Apollo, is it okay if I talk to someone about you?

00:12:15.590 --> 00:12:16.450
No way!

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:17.570
Huh?

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:20.470
Talking to humans about me 
won't accomplish anything.

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:23.270
Then, do you have a plan?

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:26.350
Um... Um...

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:29.380
Let me be honest... I'm very stupid!

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:31.040
That doesn't help.

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:32.770
I'm a holy maiden.

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.100
Thinking isn't my forte.

00:12:34.430 --> 00:12:35.920
B-But...

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:39.640
If Diana were here, she'd have some ideas...

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:40.610
Diana?

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:43.170
My younger sister... She's very smart!

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:43.960
Where is she?

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:44.760
No idea.

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:46.140
That doesn't help then!

00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:48.740
We aren't getting anywhere by ourselves!

00:12:49.190 --> 00:12:52.400
There must be someone we can turn to.

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:54.370
Wh-What?

00:12:54.680 --> 00:12:59.330
You just want an excuse to 
talk to Keima Katsuragi...

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:04.040
I can see the love inside you.

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:07.830
You only spent a week with Katsuragi.

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:10.640
It's kinda sweet

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:12.460
that you're still pining after him.

00:13:17.970 --> 00:13:21.450
<i>I'm not in love with him or anything.</i>

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:23.950
<i>But...</i>

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:27.290
<i>After Apollo appeared,</i>

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:29.830
<i>I started remembering all kinds of things.</i>

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:32.540
<i>But when I asked Keima...</i>

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:34.910
<i>You've got the wrong person.</i>

00:13:35.340 --> 00:13:36.580
<i>I don't remember a thing.</i>

00:13:39.370 --> 00:13:41.300
Good morning!

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:43.770
<i>I guess there's no point in talking to him.</i>

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:47.840
<i>No. Cop out.</i>

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:51.570
<i>He rejected me, didn't he?</i>

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:56.670
<i>There's nothing between us anymore.</i>

00:13:57.300 --> 00:14:00.430
<i>I was lost in darkness,</i>

00:14:00.430 --> 00:14:03.770
<i>could not see.</i>

00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:06.530
<i>But then I found...</i>

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:09.350
Hey.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:12.080
Are you Diana right now?

00:14:12.420 --> 00:14:14.360
You actually waited me out?

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:16.800
Only because you're trying to avoid me.

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:19.440
I told you to walk to school with Tenri.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:20.940
Excuse me...

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:23.470
Why are you walking around with an umbrella?

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:25.920
People will notice the ring 
above my head otherwise.

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:28.420
What happens if someone touches it?

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:30.420
P-Please stop.

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:30.420
Diana...

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:34.600
Why are you here, in our world?

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:37.100
A while back,

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:40.450
you mentioned that you sealed 
the loose souls long ago.

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:45.860
Does your presence here relate to 
the trouble we've been having?

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:49.850
Perhaps it does...

00:14:50.510 --> 00:14:54.060
To be honest, I don't know.

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:55.320
What do you mean?

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:59.920
At the very start, there were three worlds,

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:02.790
Heaven, Earth, and Hell,

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:04.620
which were linked by souls.

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:07.290
The humans, carriers of souls, lived on Earth.

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:11.310
After death, the souls went to Hell, 
where they were purified.

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:14.480
And Heaven restored souls to humans.

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:18.060
There was a grand cycle of souls.

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:22.570
However, the ancient demons of Hell

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:24.700
began to manipulate humans into doing evil,

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:28.940
in order to fatten and increase 
the energy of their souls.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:31.950
Then they concocted a frightening plan.

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:38.030
They planned to decimate Heaven, 
turning Earth into a graveyard for souls,

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:39.510
to rule all three worlds.

00:15:41.610 --> 00:15:46.280
And I'd guess the modern demons 
are the ones who opposed them.

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:48.260
They were not alone.

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:50.230
The ones who banished

00:15:50.230 --> 00:15:54.240
the ancient demons, known as Weiss, 
were gods from Heaven...

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:56.930
Us, the Jupiter Sisters.

00:15:57.370 --> 00:15:58.180
Sisters?

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:02.940
The ancient demons' plan targeted Heaven.

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:06.840
As we were goddesses with great power,

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:08.670
we sacrificed ourselves

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:11.320
to seal away the ancient demons 
and eliminate the threat.

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:15.920
But apparently, the seal has been broken,

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:19.620
bringing gods and ancient demons to Earth.

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:23.540
Yes, when I awakened, I was already here.

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:28.150
Then that means you have sisters?

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:31.470
It's possible that they've also arrived on Earth.

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:35.130
If that is the case, I want to see them...

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:37.370
Katsuragi?

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:37.970
Hmm?

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:40.760
Could you help me look for my sisters?

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:41.560
Hmm?

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:43.130
You would do most of the work.

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:44.220
Look for them yourself!

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:45.940
When I woke up...

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:46.480
Hey!

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:50.030
...there was a loose soul around my body.

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:53.680
I assume it was meant as a disguise

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:56.030
to cover its escape.

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:59.620
If the other goddesses are on Earth,

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:03.140
they will likely be in a similar state.

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:08.950
In other words, goddesses and loose souls coexist.

00:17:08.950 --> 00:17:12.880
By that logic, there may be 
goddesses within the girls

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:15.060
you've liberated from loose souls.

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:18.120
I need you to check each of them again.

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:21.260
Th-That isn't my problem!

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:23.450
With those loose souls, I'm busy enough.

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:25.140
I can't chase things around with no leads!

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:26.610
I have a lead!

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:27.500
What is it?

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:29.590
The other girls who host goddesses

00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:33.150
retain their memories of you, 
the same way Tenri does!

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:38.530
What?

00:17:38.960 --> 00:17:40.850
Once a loose soul is exorcised,

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:43.530
the host's memories are erased.

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:49.380
But if a goddess is inside, 
our memories can complement theirs.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:51.860
As a result, they can remember everything.

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:54.760
If the girl is host to a goddess,

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:56.340
she will remember you.

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:02.380
She'd remember me?

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:05.080
I'm counting on you.

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:07.270
H-Hey! Wait!

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:09.610
Tenri...

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:14.100
I-I'm late...

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:15.400
Seems she's causing you trouble, too.

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:20.020
<i>It's Keima and...</i>

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:21.840
<i>Who's that girl?</i>

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:23.200
Kanon!

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:25.500
Good luck on your test!

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:26.790
Kanon!

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:29.370
Kanon...

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:32.040
What is it, Apollo?

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:34.300
Someone's watching us.

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:35.830
Everyone was watching us.

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:36.790
That isn't what I mean!

00:18:36.790 --> 00:18:37.270
Hey!

00:18:37.270 --> 00:18:39.080
Not someone watching normally!

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:40.090
It felt more...

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:40.910
Different!

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:41.550
Different?

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:43.470
It's watching us right now!

00:18:49.050 --> 00:18:50.480
Don't scare me like that.

00:18:58.320 --> 00:19:00.070
<i>Who's watching us?</i>

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:05.580
<i>Diana's causing trouble again.</i>

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.870
<i>Who is Apollo, anyway?</i>

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:10.340
<i>The goddesses are inside old targets?</i>

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:13.830
<i>They could be within Chihiro or Ayumi?</i>

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:17.380
<i>Right, there's one more person in this class.</i>

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:19.630
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:20.900
<i>Kanon...</i>

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:28.230
<i>She could...</i>

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:32.310
<i>remember?</i>

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:38.010
<i>Um, have we met before?</i>

00:19:38.730 --> 00:19:39.950
<i>Forget it!</i>

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:42.320
<i>I have no reason to help Diana!</i>

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:02.570
What was that?!

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:07.460
Ms. Okada, pick up!

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:10.550
Ah, Ms. Okada!

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:14.900
The number you have dialed 
is currently not available...

00:20:19.660 --> 00:20:21.270
It must be fatigue...

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:24.160
I'm starting to see things

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:26.840
because I'm exhausted.

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:31.500
I'm sure

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:34.730
the broken glass was just my imagination.

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:37.410
Keima...

00:20:58.040 --> 00:20:58.820
Kanon?

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:03.570
Oh, no!

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:05.360
What are you doing?

00:21:05.970 --> 00:21:09.350
I didn't forget about you...

00:21:10.150 --> 00:21:11.460
I remember everything.

00:21:12.590 --> 00:21:16.080
You're the only one I can turn to.

00:21:16.610 --> 00:21:18.040
Wait, come with me!

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:18.690
Eh?

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:20.050
Kanon!

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:21.800
She and the dweeb are close?

00:21:22.470 --> 00:21:25.530
Are you saying you remember how we met?

00:21:25.530 --> 00:21:26.520
Yes.

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:28.260
You remember Seaside Hall and the roof?

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:29.510
I remember!

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:33.140
Our kiss...

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:37.810
Do you remember our kiss?

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:45.220
Yeah.

00:21:47.270 --> 00:21:50.690
So you didn't forget, either.

00:21:53.010 --> 00:21:56.000
Hey! We're in the middle of a test!

00:21:54.480 --> 00:21:56.000
I... I...

00:21:56.930 --> 00:21:58.650
I love you, Keima!

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:00.310
I've...

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:02.570
I've wanted to say it for so long!

00:22:03.740 --> 00:22:05.300
I love you, Keima!

00:22:06.360 --> 00:22:08.310
Kanon's in love with the dweeb?

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:08.310
Hey, you two!

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:09.640
No way!

00:22:09.880 --> 00:22:10.600
They ran away!

00:22:10.950 --> 00:22:12.760
What are you talking about?

00:22:13.120 --> 00:22:16.150
K-Keima, someone's chasing me!

00:22:16.150 --> 00:22:16.810
Who?!

00:22:21.490 --> 00:22:24.650
Humans should stay out of this.

00:22:24.950 --> 00:22:25.540
A ring...

00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:26.910
Oh, we traded places!

00:22:26.910 --> 00:22:29.060
I can feel my power starting to return.

00:22:29.060 --> 00:22:30.830
Thanks to you.

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:32.530
But that's enough.

00:22:32.990 --> 00:22:36.710
Don't wanna involve innocent bystanders.

00:22:36.970 --> 00:22:38.200
Kanon!

00:22:38.200 --> 00:22:39.420
Exalted Brother!

00:22:39.890 --> 00:22:42.840
What happened to Kanon?

00:22:43.280 --> 00:22:44.130
There's a goddess...

00:22:45.020 --> 00:22:47.930
There's a goddess inside Kanon!

00:22:49.390 --> 00:22:50.640
Having said that,

00:22:51.080 --> 00:22:52.950
I still can't fly...

00:22:53.690 --> 00:22:56.140
So I need to find somewhere to hide!

00:23:05.520 --> 00:23:06.650
An agent from Hell?

00:23:07.350 --> 00:23:10.360
You must be the one who's been following me!

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:11.780
Jupiter Sisters...

00:23:17.740 --> 00:23:19.280
Damn...

00:23:19.280 --> 00:23:21.030
Why are you after me?

00:23:21.030 --> 00:23:24.320
We goddesses saved Hell!

00:23:24.320 --> 00:23:26.920
As long as the goddesses are around,

00:23:26.920 --> 00:23:29.430
we can never revive the glorious Hell of yore.

00:23:29.800 --> 00:23:31.190
Revive Hell?

00:23:45.870 --> 00:23:47.820
Who are you—

00:23:57.660 --> 00:23:58.660
Lune...

00:24:00.350 --> 00:24:02.760
Lune, of Vintage.

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:20.240
<b>Scramble Formation</b>

00:24:05.440 --> 00:24:06.710
Divine Brother!

00:24:06.710 --> 00:24:08.710
Someone stabbed Kanon!

00:24:08.710 --> 00:24:09.690
It's my fault...

00:24:09.690 --> 00:24:12.070
I should've known something was wrong sooner.

00:24:12.070 --> 00:24:13.730
To prevent this from happening again,

00:24:13.730 --> 00:24:15.170
I will go conquest crazy!

00:24:15.170 --> 00:24:16.980
Wh-What should I do?

00:24:16.980 --> 00:24:17.700
Become an idol!

00:24:17.700 --> 00:24:19.400
You must become an idol!

00:24:19.400 --> 00:24:20.240
Huh?
